# Chat title prefix (sume-com)

Global rule: `~/.cursor/rules/chat-title-folder-prefix.mdc`

In this workspace the folder basename is `sume-com`, so rename titles as:

- `[sume-com] Map system`
- `[sume-com] Railway avatar lookup`

Do not drop the `[sume-com]` prefix when updating the title for a new topic.
